{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2301","published":"2026-05-15T11:11:16Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:53.596198729Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-44927","CVE-2026-44928"],"summary":"uriparser security update","details":"The package is a strictly RFC 3986 compliant URI parsing library written in C89(&amp;quot;ANSI C&amp;quot;). uriparser is cross-platform, fast, supports Unicode and is licensed under the New BSD license. There are a number of applications, libraries and hardware using uriparser, as well as bindings and 3rd-party wrappers. uriparser is packaged in major distributions.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nIn uriparser before 1.0.2, there is pointer difference truncation to int in various places.(CVE-2026-44927)\n\nIn uriparser before 1.0.2, the function family EqualsUri can misclassify two unequal URIs as equal.(CVE-2026-44928)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"uriparser","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/uriparser&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["uriparser-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","uriparser-debuginfo-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","uriparser-debugsource-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","uriparser-devel-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["uriparser-help-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["uriparser-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["uriparser-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","uriparser-debuginfo-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","uriparser-debugsource-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","uriparser-devel-1.0.1-2.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2301.json"}},{"package":{"name":"uriparser","ecosystem":"openEuler:20.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/uriparser&distro=openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.0.1-2.oe2003sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["uriparser